2. In this Order, unless the context otherwise requires —
“casino operator” means Marina Bay Sands Pte. Ltd. or Resorts World at Sentosa Pte. Ltd., as the case may be;
“responsible gambling programme” has the same meaning as in regulation 2 of the Casino Control (Responsible Gambling) Regulations 2013 (G.N. No. S 332/2013).
